---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="School Profile & Accountability Data | Tułen Charter School"
  description="State of Alaska performance metrics, KPBSD charter contract details, student enrollment demographics, and educational standards at Tułen Charter School."
>
  
  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="bg-teal-950 text-white py-16 sm:py-20 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        State Accountability & Profile
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight">
        School Profile & Charter Data
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-200 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-3xl font-normal leading-relaxed">
        Transparency, educational evaluation metrics, state accreditation reports, and charter contract compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DATA METRICS & SUMMARY -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-sand border-b border-sand-border">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Metric Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center">
          <span class="block font-serif font-extrabold text-4xl text-teal-900">1:12</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 block">Student-Teacher Ratio</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Small class sizes ensuring personalized literacy support.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center">
          <span class="block font-serif font-extrabold text-4xl text-teal-900">K &ndash; 4</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 block">Grade Band</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Early elementary focus with expanding grade levels.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center">
          <span class="block font-serif font-extrabold text-4xl text-teal-900">100%</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 block">Certified Faculty</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">All lead teachers hold Alaska State Certification.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-2 text-center">
          <span class="block font-serif font-extrabold text-4xl text-teal-900">March 2025</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 block">State Board Approval</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Charter approved by Alaska Department of Education.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- State Reports & Accountability -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-3xl text-teal-950">State Assessment & Accreditation</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          Tułen Charter School participates in the Alaska System of Academic Readiness (AK STAR) assessments, MAP Growth reading & math progress monitoring, and Alaska Science Assessments for 4th graders.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
          <div class="p-6 bg-sand rounded-2xl border border-sand-border space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-teal-900 text-lg">Literacy & Reading Performance</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Using place-based literature and evidence-based science of reading instruction, 88% of K-2 students meet or exceed mid-year benchmark goals.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-sand rounded-2xl border border-sand-border space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-teal-900 text-lg">Cultural Integration Evaluation</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Developed in partnership with Kenaitze Indian Tribe cultural specialists, our cultural rubrics track Dena'ina vocabulary acquisition and subsistence ecology skills.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
